    <apiVersion>65.0</apiVersion>
    <description>Operator retry for a failed billing sync (STA §3.4). UI only: BillingSyncService.retry owns the logic and checks the EH_Retry_Integration custom permission server-side, so non-operators land on the error screen.</description>
