            <fieldText>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;{!Get_Log.Name}&lt;/strong&gt; is &lt;strong&gt;{!Get_Log.Status__c}&lt;/strong&gt; after {!Get_Log.Attempt_Count__c} attempt(s).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;{!Get_Log.Sanitized_Error__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Retry reuses the same idempotency key, so billing (simulated Zuora) can&apos;t create a duplicate subscription. Fix the cause first for Validation or Authentication errors.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
